<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the first demise of the Wabigoto Arc [Apology].<PG>
Just when it seemed the Megasawa City case had been averted, the Kogori family and the Niimura family alike are as you have seen, in Shiyo 790, let alone Shiyo 800. It seems they met a worse end.<PG>
Naturally, a wrong choice was made somewhere. Does <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama know what it was?
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
